# Utility CMM-aligned Canonical Data Model (Silver) v1.0.0 | source: Databricks lakehouse-industry-data-models energy_utilities v1 ECM | generated 2026-10-13
# Subset of the IEC TC57 CIM (CIM100 namespace) referenced by the CMM canonical model, so that the ontology is self-contained.
# Normative source: IEC 61970-301, IEC 61968-11, IEC 62325-301 UML (CIM Users Group). Definitions abridged.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
